t with just the rule of Dreadfell. No, soon I shall have more. Much more. My boots shall tread the surface of the earth! I shall explore and destroy the most beautiful mountains. All shall be mine once I can walk in the sun once more. Where will you be? Do you wish to be more than the wight I stepped on yesterday? I shall need great leaders to guide my armies across the land.","source_tag":"_t","target":"奴才们：汝等之所以只是微不足道的污秽巢穴，莫非是因为没有可追求的目标？若眼前有个更恶劣的榜样，汝等或许便能更加伟大？看看吾！吾开始这漫长的不死生涯时，也曾是汝等这般愚蠢的小角色。吾甚至有过连一个坑洞都未征服的时期，更不必说一层区域或整座地城。如今，看看吾拥有的一切。\n\n汝等必须心怀抱负。吾绝不满足于仅仅统治恐惧王座。不，吾很快还会拥有更多，多得多。吾之长靴将踏上地表！吾将探索并摧毁最美丽的群山。待吾能再次行走于阳光下，一切都将归吾所有。那时汝等又会身在何处？汝等是否想比吾昨日踩过的那只尸妖更有出息？吾需要伟大的统帅率领大军横越这片土地。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fd7ce927324f3f2e079bc13b1bbc1c1d3a3bd80a5e7ebf2d650b5d1e53859af0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2e2f7ad443f9fd028b1f42f2068609cc02873943efb85fa33f20237dfa330a94","logical_entry_identity":"3d6b4e1e1a415ad86f9447da29372219085bab4cb930a853970f523bf1373265","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Resonate with psionic, nature, and anti-magic powered objects you wear, increasing your physical and mind power by %0.1f or %d%% of the object's material level (whichever is lower).\n\t\tThis effect stacks and applies for each qualifying object worn.\n\t\tCurrent bonus: %d","source_tag":"tformat","target":"与你装备着的具有灵能、自然或反魔力量的物品产生共鸣，增加你 %0.1f 点或 %d%% 物品材质等级数值（取较小值）的物理和精神强度。\n\t\t此效果可以叠加，并且适用于所有符合条件的已穿戴装备。\n\t\t当前加成：%d"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4a5970ba03ca80ded8a4a254af2bf4176aa34ee8e9f9a72743324ea2bde5715f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2e3444bab858b6f5774e6df8e412ab6b329c52345f2399de134f8880a1700faa","logical_entry_identity":"59efc66ce0236b47d17c397ab2c04e7787787a3170afb93e10633df7f57b881e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"pair of shifting boots","source_tag":"_t","target":"一双可以闪现的靴子"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"22d2b45f1afa9a48edcc477e234c3bd3290e5fd5dd3b1efcba37577c326913da","component":"tome","entry_revisi